WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:04.200
♪♪

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.601
-Let's get to the news!

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:08.501
President Biden returned
to the White House this morning

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:11.400
after spending the weekend at
his beach house in Delaware.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.834
Things must be pretty rough
in Washington

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:16.467
if you think to yourself,
"You know what would be great?

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.334
The beach in November."

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:19.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:22.033
According to a new pool,
61% of voters approve

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.234
of the bipartisan
infrastructure bill,

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:27.567
at least until Biden signs it.

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.334
Former President Barack Obama

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:31.868
spoke today at the U.N.
climate summit in Scotland

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:34.667
where he warned that
without immediate action

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.367
global temperatures could rise

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:39.067
by as much as two more buttons.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:42.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.067
The "Sesame Street" character
Big Bird

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.133
announced over the weekend
on social media

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:48.234
that he received
his coronavirus vaccine shot.

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:50.701
"We'll take him!"
said the Packers.

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:52.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:54.734
Good graphic.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:57.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.234
It's a good Photoshop.
You wait all day.

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:01.300
I don't see 'em --
I see 'em when you see 'em.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.534
And I'm pretty happy about it.
You know?

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:06.300
According to a new report,
President Biden farted

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:10.133
while speaking to Britain's
Duchess Camilla Parker Bowles

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:13.367
at the U.N. climate summit,
which brings us to a segment

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:15.701
called, "How Is There
Not Video of This?!"

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:22.000
How's there not video of this?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.234
Do you know what kind of
currency that clip would be

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:25.834
for monologue writers?

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:27.801
Think of how many times you've
seen his falling up the stairs.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:30.200
Now imagine if instead of
falling up the stairs

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.968
he was tearin' ass
in front of a royal?

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:34.434
How's there not video of this?

00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:36.667
I'd rather not even know
what happened...

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:39.133
than know what happened,
but I'll never see it.

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.501
Be like if you just heard about

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.334
that news reporter
stomping grapes.

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:45.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.000
Well.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.934
Maybe that'll cheer me up.
Can we just show that?

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:52.300
-Oh. Oh!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.868
Oh! Ogh-ogh-ogh-ogh!

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:57.501
-Yeah.

00:01:57.501 --> 00:01:59.234
Yeah, that helped.

00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:02.601
-This has been "How Is There
Not Video of This?!"

00:02:02.601 --> 00:02:03.934
-That's right.

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:05.934
Apparently, Britain's
Duchess Camilla Parker Bowles

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:07.567
hasn't been able
to stop talking about

00:02:07.567 --> 00:02:11.334
how President Biden let out
a loud, long fart

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:14.000
when they spoke at last week's
U.N. climate summit.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.767
To be fair, he warned her that
he was about to cut methane gas.

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.634 --> 00:02:22.133
Does that mean that's wor--
that she --

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:23.934
I just would have thought

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:28.501
a duchess would have
a different word than "fart."

00:02:28.501 --> 00:02:30.868
Learn a new thing every day.

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:33.133
A couple in New Zealand
recently grew a potato

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:36.267
that was about 17 pounds
and named it Doug.

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:38.300
It's what many in New Zealand

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.300
are calling
"our top story tonight."

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:44.901
Several inmates
at an Oklahoma jail

00:02:44.901 --> 00:02:47.000
recently filed a federal lawsuit
that claims

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.033
they had been tortured
by being forced to listen

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:51.701
to the song "Baby Shark"
on repeat for hours.

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:54.000
So if you're wondering
whether we need prison reform,

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.234
I'd say we definitely...

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:57.167
♪ Do, do, do,
do-do-do-do-do-do ♪

00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:58.634
♪ Do, do, do ♪

00:02:58.634 --> 00:03:01.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.033 --> 00:03:04.067
Finally, today was
celebrity chef Gordon Ramsey's

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:05.267
55th birthday.

00:03:05.267 --> 00:03:07.267
He spent the day
exactly the way he wanted to --

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:10.100
screaming at the person
who baked his cake!

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.267
♪♪

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.567
11 democratic senators

00:03:13.567 --> 00:03:15.868
sent a letter
to President Biden yesterday,

00:03:15.868 --> 00:03:20.033
calling on him to explore
options to lower gas prices,

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.901
which has to be so aggravating,

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:25.234
for a guy who's been hawking
Amtrak for 40 years.

00:03:25.234 --> 00:03:28.167
[ As Biden ] Oh,
are gas prices too high?

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.300
God, I wish I had
an idea for you.

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:34.534
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
filed paperwork yesterday

00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:37.734
to run for reelection in 2022,
which, in Florida,

00:03:37.734 --> 00:03:40.801
is just finishing the maze
on the back page of Highlights.

00:03:40.801 --> 00:03:43.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.501
The writer who wrote that
is from Florida.

00:03:45.501 --> 00:03:47.367
[ Laughter and applause ]
I don't want anyone to think

00:03:47.367 --> 00:03:50.133
that it's just like us global --
whatever, coastal elites.

00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:51.501
Global elites.

00:03:51.501 --> 00:03:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:56.167
Republican Representative
Paul Gosar on Sunday

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:58.734
tweeted a digitally editade --
edited, excuse me --

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:00.834
animé-style video
that appeared to show him

00:04:00.834 --> 00:04:03.501
attacking Congresswoman
Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:04.734
and President Joe Biden.

00:04:04.734 --> 00:04:08.167
You edited yourself
into an animé cartoon?

00:04:08.167 --> 00:04:09.934
[ Laughter ]
You're like that kid

00:04:09.934 --> 00:04:12.567
in elementary school
who insists he knows kung fu,

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:14.601
but legally isn't allowed
to show you.

00:04:14.601 --> 00:04:16.667
[ Laughter and applause ]
"My hands are registered

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.167
with the FBI, so..."

00:04:18.167 --> 00:04:19.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:22.400
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
jokingly threatened

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.067
actor Leonardo DiCaprio
yesterday on Twitter

00:04:25.067 --> 00:04:27.367
after a video surfaced
showing DiCaprio talking

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:29.200
with Bezos' girlfriend
at a gala.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.701
What a scandal!

00:04:30.701 --> 00:04:35.234
DiCaprio was talking to a woman
over the age of 30?!

00:04:35.234 --> 00:04:39.100
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.868
West Virginia
Senator Joe Manchin

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:42.634
is reportedly in talks
for a book deal.

00:04:42.634 --> 00:04:45.267
Well, technically, someone else
will write the book,

00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:47.367
then, he'll cut out
all the good parts.

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:50.267
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:04:51.701 --> 00:04:53.300
And that's budget comedy.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:54.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:57.467
Ooh, you came from budget comedy
and here it is.

00:04:57.467 --> 00:04:59.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.300
In a new interview,
New York Mayor-elect Eric Adams

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.234
suggested that cryptocurrency
should be taught in schools.

00:05:05.234 --> 00:05:08.434
Oh, no, are we going to end up
missing this guy?

00:05:08.434 --> 00:05:10.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:10.534 --> 00:05:12.767
France's Catholic Church
announced yesterday

00:05:12.767 --> 00:05:15.534
that it would financially
compensate sex abuse victims

00:05:15.534 --> 00:05:17.701
by selling assets
or taking on loans,

00:05:17.701 --> 00:05:20.033
which explains this new listing
on Zillow.

00:05:20.033 --> 00:05:23.901
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:05:23.901 --> 00:05:26.000
[ Cheering ]

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.133
Looks very nice.

00:05:28.133 --> 00:05:30.968
According to a new report,
a 39,000-ton pile

00:05:30.968 --> 00:05:33.834
of unsold clothes
from fast fashion retailers

00:05:33.834 --> 00:05:36.000
has accumulated
in the Chilean desert.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.334
Now, all they have to do is
build four walls around it

00:05:38.334 --> 00:05:39.634
and throw up a sign.

00:05:39.634 --> 00:05:42.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:44.033
According --

00:05:45.367 --> 00:05:47.601
According to a new study,
going to bed too early

00:05:47.601 --> 00:05:49.968
or too late may disrupt
the body's natural rhythm

00:05:49.968 --> 00:05:52.234
and increase the risk
of cardiovascular disease.

00:05:52.234 --> 00:05:53.901
So, just to be safe, let's all

00:05:53.901 --> 00:05:57.200
randomly change our clocks
twice a year for no reason.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:58.467 --> 00:06:00.334
Nike has filed for trademarks

00:06:00.334 --> 00:06:02.133
for a new line
of virtual clothing.

00:06:02.133 --> 00:06:04.300
It'll be the first
Nike clothing line

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.734
made entirely
by virtual children.

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:08.067
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:10.234
Now...

00:06:11.234 --> 00:06:13.701
...when you guys didn't take
to the T.J.Maxx joke,

00:06:13.701 --> 00:06:15.834
I had a feeling --
[ Laughter ]

00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:18.934
I had a feeling this one was
going to be pretty bumpy, and...

00:06:18.934 --> 00:06:20.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.968 --> 00:06:21.901
...called it.

00:06:21.901 --> 00:06:24.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.634
And, finally, former
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:06:26.634 --> 00:06:29.501
over the weekend wished his dog
Captain a happy fourth birthday

00:06:29.501 --> 00:06:30.868
in a post on social media.

00:06:30.868 --> 00:06:34.033
Unfortunately, Captain
unfollowed him a long time ago.

00:06:34.033 --> 00:06:35.367
♪♪

00:06:35.367 --> 00:06:37.734
According to a new report
from the Labor Department,

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:42.100
U.S. consumer prices are surging
more than they have in 30 years.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:45.367
Okay, how much more bad news
is Biden going to get?

00:06:45.367 --> 00:06:46.801
[ Laughter ]
At the end of the month,

00:06:46.801 --> 00:06:48.701
we're going to find out
the turkey he pardoned was

00:06:48.701 --> 00:06:50.834
at the Capitol on January 6th.

00:06:50.834 --> 00:06:52.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:52.367 --> 00:06:55.601
A federal judge ruled last night
that former President Trump

00:06:55.601 --> 00:06:57.033
cannot shield
White House records

00:06:57.033 --> 00:06:58.400
from the House Select Committee

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.901
investigating
January's Capitol attack.

00:07:00.901 --> 00:07:02.501
Oh, he really wants to, though.

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:03.968
He's acting like a boyfriend

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:06.234
who just had his phone snatched
out of his hand.

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:08.734
"You don't have to hold it
to look at it!

00:07:08.734 --> 00:07:10.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.667 --> 00:07:12.734
I will just show it to you,
but don't scroll!

00:07:12.734 --> 00:07:15.667
[ Laughter ]
Uh, scrolling uses up battery!

00:07:15.667 --> 00:07:17.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.033 --> 00:07:18.601
During a visit
to the White House on Monday

00:07:18.601 --> 00:07:21.901
to celebrate winning
the 2021 NBA Championship,

00:07:21.901 --> 00:07:23.901
the Milwaukee Bucks
gave President Biden

00:07:23.901 --> 00:07:26.467
a custom jersey
with the number 46 on the back

00:07:26.467 --> 00:07:28.634
and he was really excited
because he thought it was

00:07:28.634 --> 00:07:29.734
his approval rating.

00:07:29.734 --> 00:07:31.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.968 --> 00:07:34.033
Twitter yesterday launched
its so-called

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:36.601
Twitter Blue subscription
service in the U.S.,

00:07:36.601 --> 00:07:38.901
which will cost
around $3 per month

00:07:38.901 --> 00:07:42.167
and allow users to undo tweets
before they post.

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:45.133
Or, for $6 per month,
you can get Twitter Gold,

00:07:45.133 --> 00:07:47.501
and they'll just delete
your account entirely.

00:07:47.501 --> 00:07:49.334
[ Laughter ]

00:07:49.334 --> 00:07:51.534
After missing this week's game,
due to COVID,

00:07:51.534 --> 00:07:53.200
Green Bay quarterback
Aaron Rodgers said,

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.934
in a new interview,
that he has had

00:07:54.934 --> 00:07:57.934
"a lot of time for reflection
while in quarantine."

00:07:57.934 --> 00:08:00.200
Unfortunately,
he does all his best thinking

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.334
in the shower
and, as you can see...

00:08:02.334 --> 00:08:05.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:06.934 --> 00:08:10.100
Television host Dr. Oz is
reportedly considering running

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.701
for a senate seat
in Pennsylvania.

00:08:11.701 --> 00:08:15.734
What? Who would ever want Dr. Oz
to be their senator?

00:08:15.734 --> 00:08:17.000
The only thing crazier would be

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.834
wanting Dr. Oz to be
your doctor.

00:08:19.834 --> 00:08:22.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:22.267 --> 00:08:24.467
It was announced today
that actor Paul Rudd is

00:08:24.467 --> 00:08:26.300
People magazine's
Sexiest Man Alive,

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:28.701
reclaiming the title
he first received

00:08:28.701 --> 00:08:30.367
in 1938.

00:08:30.367 --> 00:08:33.334
[ Laughter ]

00:08:36.033 --> 00:08:38.534
A middle school history teacher
in California

00:08:38.534 --> 00:08:39.601
was recently removed

00:08:39.601 --> 00:08:41.200
after telling students
last month

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.834
that Donald Trump
was still president.

00:08:42.834 --> 00:08:44.167
Though, for what it's worth,

00:08:44.167 --> 00:08:46.601
I bet she's still telling people
she's a teacher.

00:08:46.601 --> 00:08:49.434
[ Laughter ]

00:08:49.434 --> 00:08:52.133
Rapper Kanye West's
clothing brand Yeezy

00:08:52.133 --> 00:08:54.601
settled a lawsuit this week
with the state of California

00:08:54.601 --> 00:08:55.701
over shipping delays

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:57.601
and agreed to pay
nearly $1 million,

00:08:57.601 --> 00:08:58.734
or, as it's known at Yeezy,

00:08:58.734 --> 00:08:59.801
a shirt.

00:08:59.801 --> 00:09:01.767
[ Laughter ]

00:09:01.767 --> 00:09:04.033
Finally,
according to a new survey,

00:09:04.033 --> 00:09:06.801
40% of Americans said
that they strongly approve

00:09:06.801 --> 00:09:09.601
of "Sesame Street's" Big Bird
announcing on social media

00:09:09.601 --> 00:09:11.234
that he got
a coronavirus vaccine.

00:09:11.234 --> 00:09:13.367
They were less comfortable,
though, with hearing

00:09:13.367 --> 00:09:16.200
why Oscar needed
the hep C vaccine.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.868
♪♪

00:09:17.868 --> 00:09:20.067
President Biden is set on Monday

00:09:20.067 --> 00:09:22.868
to sign the bipartisan
infrastructure bill into law,

00:09:22.868 --> 00:09:25.734
provided they can get
Joe Manchin off of it.

00:09:25.734 --> 00:09:27.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.334
After New Hampshire
Governor Chris Sununu

00:09:29.334 --> 00:09:32.834
announced this week that he will
not run next year for Senate,

00:09:32.834 --> 00:09:35.634
Minority Leader Mitch McConnell
is reportedly upset

00:09:35.634 --> 00:09:37.767
that Sununu did not give him
advance notice

00:09:37.767 --> 00:09:39.834
or -- hear me out --

00:09:39.834 --> 00:09:40.968
that's just how he looks.

00:09:40.968 --> 00:09:42.801
[ Laughter ]

00:09:42.801 --> 00:09:45.133
That photo was taken
at Six Flags.

00:09:45.133 --> 00:09:47.501
[ Laughter ]

00:09:47.501 --> 00:09:49.367
During their virtual summit
next week,

00:09:49.367 --> 00:09:52.100
Chinese, President Xi Jinping
is reportedly expected

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:55.667
to invite President Biden to the
2022 Beijing Winter Olympics,

00:09:55.667 --> 00:09:58.767
but, for his part,
Biden says he'll only go

00:09:58.767 --> 00:10:00.100
if he qualifies.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.133
[ Laughter ]

00:10:02.133 --> 00:10:05.067
According a new poll,
76% of Americans said

00:10:05.067 --> 00:10:07.234
that Facebook
makes society worse.

00:10:07.234 --> 00:10:10.133
Said Zuckerberg, "Right,
but what do you think of Meta?"

00:10:10.133 --> 00:10:12.133
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.133 --> 00:10:14.934
Apple CEO Tim Cook said,
in an interview this week,

00:10:14.934 --> 00:10:17.200
that he's worried
about the amount of time

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.267
people spend "scrolling
mindlessly" on their devices,

00:10:20.267 --> 00:10:23.234
which is kind of like hearing
that your weed dealer

00:10:23.234 --> 00:10:24.834
is worried you sleep too much.

00:10:24.834 --> 00:10:27.067
[ Laughter ]

00:10:27.067 --> 00:10:29.501
The Canadian fast-food chain
Tim Hortons announced

00:10:29.501 --> 00:10:31.601
a collaboration
with pop star Justin Bieber

00:10:31.601 --> 00:10:34.100
to launch three new flavors
of doughnut holes.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.133
When they first come out,
they'll be cute,

00:10:36.133 --> 00:10:38.167
but then, they'll become
really annoying.

00:10:38.167 --> 00:10:39.868
[ Laughter ]
Then, all of a sudden,

00:10:39.868 --> 00:10:40.934
you'll be like, "Wait a minute.

00:10:40.934 --> 00:10:43.133
Are these doughnut holes
actually good?"

00:10:43.133 --> 00:10:45.501
[ Laughter ]
Before realizing you are

00:10:45.501 --> 00:10:46.834
way too old to be enjoying them.

00:10:46.834 --> 00:10:48.868
[ Laughter ]

00:10:48.868 --> 00:10:50.934
A 105-year-old runner,

00:10:50.934 --> 00:10:54.033
Julia "Hurricane" Hawkins,
recently set a world record

00:10:54.033 --> 00:10:56.534
in the 100-meter dash
for her age group.

00:10:56.534 --> 00:10:58.767
The new record is eight meters.

00:10:58.767 --> 00:11:01.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:10.067
I'm totally fine
with your reaction.

00:11:10.067 --> 00:11:11.801
[ Laughter ]

00:11:11.801 --> 00:11:14.267
According to new reports,
reality star Kim Kardashian's

00:11:14.267 --> 00:11:16.300
shapewear brand SKIMS'
collaboration

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:18.467
with the luxury
fashion brand Fendi

00:11:18.467 --> 00:11:19.868
sold out in just one minute,

00:11:19.868 --> 00:11:21.968
continuing the Kardashian
family trend

00:11:21.968 --> 00:11:23.367
of immediately selling out.

00:11:23.367 --> 00:11:24.701
[ Laughter ]

00:11:24.701 --> 00:11:26.934
And, finally, today is

00:11:26.934 --> 00:11:29.767
actor Leonardo DiCaprio's
47th birthday

00:11:29.767 --> 00:11:31.200
and, when he blew out
the candles,

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.300
he was still Leonardo DiCaprio.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:35.634
[ Laughter ]
"Hey, I got my wish!"

00:11:35.634 --> 00:11:37.801
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

00:11:37.801 --> 00:11:41.634
♪♪

